# ─── Go build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/bin/
/tmp/
*.exe
*.test
*.so
*.dylib

# Binaries that "go build ./cmd/..." or "go build ./deploy/..." drop in the root
/alexandria
/alexandria-server
/alexandria-client
/alexandriac
/fake-idp
/fake-connector

# Coverage, profiles and workspace files
coverage.out
coverage.html
*.prof
go.work
go.work.sum

# ─── Runtime state of the binaries ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Hub database, blobs, lab TLS material and client events (config/*.yaml paths)
/var/
# Default -state-dir of alexandria-client
/alexandria-client-state/
# SQLite files wherever a custom configuration puts them
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
# Client event sink
events.jsonl
# Logs
*.log

# ─── Keys, certificates and secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Private keys and certificates are generated per machine (hub signing key,
# lab TLS, fake-idp key). Committing one would let anyone impersonate the lab.
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
/fake-idp.key

# The project's local certificate authority: a signing key, and a root that a
# machine has been told to trust. Committing it would hand anyone who clones the
# repository the ability to impersonate any site on every machine that trusts it.
/.certs/

# Local configuration and secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.token

# ─── Console (gui/) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/gui/node_modules/
/gui/dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
# Console build embedded with -tags gui (produced by `make build-gui`)
/internal/webui/dist/

# ─── Documentation site (docs/, Fumadocs) ────────────────────────────────────
/docs/node_modules/
/docs/.next/
/docs/out/
/docs/.source/

# ─── Node tooling, anywhere ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ─── Tutorials (Python, Jupyter) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
/tutorial/.venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ─── Deployment ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Helm subcharts, fetched by `helm dependency update`. Chart.lock is committed —
# it pins what was fetched — but the archives themselves are downloads.
/deploy/k8s/charts/*/charts/

# ─── Internal notes ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Working documents, not part of the published repository
/docs/internal/
/docs/artifacts/
CURRENT_NOTES.md
/CLAUDE.md
/GEMINI.md
DECISIONS.md
PROFILES_DSL.md
OPEN_QUESTIONS.md
TRACEABILITY.md

# ─── Assistants and code-intelligence tools ──────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.codegraph/

# ─── OS and editors ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ─── Scratch files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
